            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>if deyiminin kod bloğunu oluşturmak için display deyimini süslü parantezlerin arasına ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level complete!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>{</code>, ardından <code>console.log</code> ve sonra <code>\"Level complete!\"</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
